			"notes": "**Now runs on NeoForge with supports for Minecraft 1.21 and 1.21.1, with refactorings on old codebase and fixes.**\n\n# Textures\n\n* Reworked texture for Feather Wings, Colored Feather Wings and Golden Feather Wings.\n\n# Refactoring\n\n* Rescructured Item package, removing unneccessary classes.\n* Migrated Item Models, Block States and Block Models, Recipes, Advancements, Particles, Sound Definitions to be data generated.\n* Mobs drops and relic loot now are added using GLM.\n* Reworked code for Enchantment Tags and Damage Types\n* Reworked Effect application logic\n* Reworked Advancements to have more precise requirements.\n* Changed Artemis Missile launch position to eye level.\n* Tweaked Artemis Transport Card logic to let missiles form a circle when launched from any angle.\n\n# Fixes\n\n* Fixed Cape Layer Mixin not working correctly.\n* Fixed Wings not rendering on Armor Stands\n* Fixed Sword and Pickaxe not having default attributes.\n* Fixed issue where only half of Amphora is placed.\n* Fixed / 0 crash in Interdiction effect tick.\n* Fixed Spear item data sync issue.\n* Fixed Melon not held in intended position.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/IcarusWings/compare/0.6.1...0.7.0"
		},
