			"notes": "This is the 1.19.2 port, the contents of gameplay should be in line with version 0.4.0 (last 1.18.2 version). However this port includes many of the new overhauled textures by @Zoshsgahdnkc.\n\n## What's Changed\n* 更新部分物品的纹理 by @Zoshsgahdnkc in https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/icaruswings_mod/pull/27\n* 第二部分材质更新 by @Zoshsgahdnkc in https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/icaruswings_mod/pull/28\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Zoshsgahdnkc made their first contribution in https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/icaruswings_mod/pull/27\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/icaruswings_mod/compare/0.4.0...0.5.0"
