			"notes": "**Code Name: Demeter**\n\n# Additions\n\n## Item\n- Flax\n    - Can be processed into seeds or string.\n- Flax Seeds\n    - Sold by farmer villagers, can be planted and harvested for Flax.\n- Linen String\n    - Replaces Wheat String in Linen recipe.\n- Grains Meal\n    - Bowl food crafted with wheat grains or flax seeds (items with crop_grains tag).\n- Ambrosia of Growth\n    - Crafted from Ambrosia and crop grains.\n    - When used on Dirt or Grass Block, transforms these blocks in a 3x3x3 area into Elysium conterparts.\n    - Also converts a single Sheep into Golden Ram if present in the area of effect.\n- Golden Ram Spawn Egg\n- Golden Fleece\n    - Used as crafting material.\n- Golden Fleece Mantle\n    - Armor crafted with Golden Fleece.\n- Herb Bunch\n    - Crafted with items with herbs tag, used as crafting material.\n- Demeter\n    - Weapon of the same name from anime.\n    - Fires projectiles dealing damage and changing terrain. (Can be disabled in config.)\n- Demeter Charge\n- Icarus Wings Badge\n    - Vanity item with the new icon as texture.\n\n## Block\n- Honey Cake\n    - Cake like items crafted with honey instead of sugar.\n- Elysium Grass Block, Elysium Soil and Elysium Grass\n    - Acquired by using Ambrosia of Growth on regular Grass Block or Dirt.\n- Golden Wool Block and Golden Wool Carpet\n    - Decorative blocks crafted from Golden Fleece, emits light.\n\n## Entity\n- Golden Ram\n    - Converted from Sheep when in effect area of an Ambrosia of Growth.\n- Kayros Energy Blast\n    - Projectile from Demeter attacks.\n\n## Mechanic\n- Added growing Flax crops.\n- Elysium-type blocks and Golden Ram now can be acquired using Ambrosia of Growth.\n- Added Golden Ram shearing and grazing mechanic.\n- Added more trades to Villagers and Wandering Traders.\n- Added Config setting for Demeter terrain changing attack.\n\n# Changes\n\n## General\n- New Mod Icon.\n- Bumped Forge dependency to 40.1.\n\n## Content\n- Flandre Wings now has 495 durability.\n- Herbs Infused Mead now uses Herb Bunch as ingredient.\n- Nerfed Infused Mead crafting recipes.\n- Linen is now crafted with Linen Strings.\n- Synapse Wings balancing.\n- Melon now has a new model.\n\n## Mechanic\n- Improved Mead infusion mechanics, ingredients can be dropped into the pot during fermentation stage to change the infusion type of the product.\n- Added `crop_strings` and `crop_grains` tags to use in recipes.\n- Wings now opens wide when under Slow Falling or Levitation effect.\n- Herb Infused Mead now gives Poison Immunity effect.\n\n# Fixes\n- Fixed Mending enchantment on Synapse Wings causing stack overflow. (#26)\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LocusAzzurro/icaruswings_mod/compare/0.3.0...0.4.0"
		},
